 "_comment": "Block Puzzle screenshot capture: gameplay boards only. Score game (no level list): each slot calls window.bpShot(seed, moves, theme, drag), which plays a REAL classic run on a fixed dealer seed with the greedy bot for that many placements and renders it mid-play (no overlay, coachmark, toast or popup). drag=true leaves the next piece lifted over its drop spot so the ghost preview and the will-clear glow show. 11 distinct seed/move boards; every glaze theme appears (default Rose Glaze, Celadon, Delft Blue, Raku, Midnight Glaze, Majolica, Stoneware).",
